{"id":"s02","text":"In spec-driven development, a developer and an agent write a specification, usually a Markdown file, before any code exists. The agent then plans, builds, and verifies against it. Tools like GitHub's Spec Kit, Amazon's Kiro, and Fission AI's OpenSpec have carried the practice into more than seventy-three thousand public repositories, almost all of them since 2025.","alignment":{"characters":["I","n"," ","s","p","e","c","-","d","r","i","v","e","n"," ","d","e","v","e","l","o","p","m","e","n","t",","," ","a"," ","d","e","v","e","l","o","p","e","r"," ","a","n","d"," ","a","n"," ","a","g","e","n","t"," ","w","r","i","t","e"," ","a"," ","s","p","e","c","i","f","i","c","a","t","i","o","n",","," ","u","s","u","a","l","l","y"," ","a"," ","M","a","r","k","d","o","w","n"," ","f","i","l","e",","," ","b","e","f","o","r","e"," ","a","n","y"," ","c","o","d","e"," ","e","x","i","s","t","s","."," ","T","h","e"," ","a","g","e","n","t"," ","t","h","e","n"," ","p","l","a","n","s",","," ","b","u","i","l","d","s",","," ","a","n","d"," ","v","e","r","i","f","i","e","s"," ","a","g","a","i","n","s","t"," ","i","t","."," ","T","o","o","l","s"," ","l","i","k","e"," ","G","i","t","H","u","b","'","s"," ","S","p","e","c"," ","K","i","t",","," ","A","m","a","z","o","n","'","s"," ","K","i","r","o",","," ","a","n","d"," ","F","i","s","s","i","o","n"," ","A","I","'","s"," ","O","p","e","n","S","p","e","c"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","c","a","r","r","i","e","d"," ","t","h","e"," ","p","r","a","c","t","i","c","e"," ","i","n","t","o"," ","m","o","r","e"," ","t","h","a","n"," ","s","e","v","e","n","t","y","-","t","h","r","e","e"," ","t","h","o","u","s","a","n","d"," ","p","u","b","l","i","c"," ","r","e","p","o","s","i","t","o","r","i","e","s",","," ","a","l","m","o","s","t"," ","a","l","l"," ","o","f"," ","t","h","e","m"," ","s","i","n","c","e"," ","2","0","2","5","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.163,0.221,0.29,0.348,0.43,0.511,0.569,0.627,0.673,0.72,0.778,0.836,0.894,0.917,0.96